        <mxCell id="seq3_v114" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fillColor=#FFF9E6;strokeColor=#B7950B;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt;: solid line + filled arrow = synchronous call · dashed line + open arrow = return · solid line + open arrow = asynchronous message (WebSocket) · «create» = a new object · loop / alt / opt = combined fragments.&lt;br&gt;Lifelines are objects of ClassDiagram.drawio and messages use its operations. Saving to PostgreSQL through EF Core is not drawn.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;font color=&quot;#1E88E5&quot;&gt;blue&lt;/font&gt; = UI · &lt;font color=&quot;#5E35B1&quot;&gt;purple&lt;/font&gt; = controller / queries · &lt;font color=&quot;#43A047&quot;&gt;green&lt;/font&gt; = exam setup objects · &lt;font color=&quot;#E53935&quot;&gt;red&lt;/font&gt; = interview and scoring objects · &lt;font color=&quot;#FB8C00&quot;&gt;orange&lt;/font&gt; = AI services · &lt;font color=&quot;#546E7A&quot;&gt;grey&lt;/font&gt; = storage. Frames: &lt;font color=&quot;#1565C0&quot;&gt;loop&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&quot;#E65100&quot;&gt;alt&lt;/font&gt;, &lt;font color=&quot;#2E7D32&quot;&gt;opt&lt;/font&gt;.&lt;br&gt;A saved draft opens with everything already saved; the lecturer continues from the first missing step." vertex="1">
